# mW ice Ic in the lower half of the cell, liquid in the upper half.
# Needs the variables cells and melt. The ice half is held while the
# upper half melts at 450 K; the caller then runs the whole cell at 260 K.
units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice diamond 6.26
region box block 0 ${cells} 0 ${cells} 0 ${cells}
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 18.015
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

variable half equal ${cells}/2
region top block INF INF INF INF ${half} INF
group liquid region top
velocity liquid create 450.0 4928459 dist gaussian
timestep 10.0
thermo 500
fix melt liquid nvt temp 450.0 450.0 1000.0
run ${melt}
unfix melt

velocity all create 260.0 87287 dist gaussian
fix prod all nvt temp 260.0 260.0 1000.0
